+/// state, and it may be a transmitted request. A request still pending is
+/// not counted here: every withdrawal path refuses while one is pending
+/// (`PendingSettlement`).
+fn unsettled_legacy_state(config: &AuthConfig, wallet: &Wallet) -> Result<bool, AuthError> {
